# A Float literal may have an exponent (S8): e or E right after the
# digits, an optional -, then digits, all touching; always a Float.
# A spaced e is a name, as before.
== SOURCE
1.5e-7 6.02e23 2E3 -1e-3 x 1.5 e3
== TOKENS
0..6 Num(1.5e-7)
7..14 Num(6.02e23)
15..18 Num(2000.0)
19..24 Num(-0.001)
25..26 Var(x)
27..30 Num(1.5)
31..33 Var(e3)
